From: Lauri Nomme <lauri.nomme@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 03:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: add RSS (Receive Side Scaling) for MT7988

Combined register-definitions + RSS support retrofit for the MT7988
(netsys v3). Adds a static Toeplitz hash key and 128-entry indirection
table, plus ethtool rxfh hooks:

  ethtool -x <iface>
  ethtool --set-rxfh-indir <iface> equal/weight ...

Gated on mtk_is_netsys_v3_or_greater() so MT7986/MT7622 in this 6.18
target are untouched. Omitted the per-RX-ring IRQ-group programming the
upstream patch carries (multi-ring NAPI); the single-NAPI RX path used by
6.18.44 already serves all rings.

Signed-off-by: Lauri Nomme <lauri.nomme@gmail.com>
diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c
